      "row_id": 425698,
      "chunk_id": "a0d2dfef0ac5_0",
      "doc_id": "a0d2dfef0ac5",
      "text": "Battery life...battery life...battery life.. To be fair, I have had many motos in the past. So, if you are looking for someone to give you descriptive \"ease of use\" specs... I'm not your guy. It may be the easiest one on the market to use, and for me it is, but have no other frame of reference, so I wouldn't know that. What I can say without hesitation is that the battery life is wonderful on these. I can go for days on a single charge and moderate use. I am the only one in my family with a moto, and my battery outlasts all of their iphones and other androids. It's not even a contest.",
