      "doc_id": "6809fd346080",
      "text": "Battery doesn't last long. What I like: I like the face recognition for sure, fingerprint reader takes time to get used to. It seems to be fast in loading apps. All in all I like the phone. What I don't like: battery life is too short, it says 2day battery but I don't think it'll last that long, it drops fast when you're using it, that seems to be the theme though with Moto phones. The phone I had prior to this one was supposedly a 3 day battery it would only last 2 days though, I wish this phone had a 3 day battery. Would I recommend yes, other than battery life it's a good phone.",
